    "description": {
        "": "Creates a parametric 3/16 in Ktech template bracket from a paper-template trace: boot-shaped plate, two 5/8 in holes and one 1/2 in hole, with DXF face export for laser or waterjet. Outline and hole locations are photo estimates (about +/- 1/8 in) — caliper and edit the named user parameters before a production cut."
